Pixel Forge Accel 0.1.0

This delivery contains original implementation code. No source code or artwork
from sprite-gen, SpriteBrew, Pixelorama, Spritesheet-Maker, LibreSprite, Universal
LPC, or the other researched applications is bundled or vendored.

Oklab color conversion uses the formula and matrix coefficients published by
Bjorn Ottosson, offered as public domain (and alternatively MIT):
https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/
The NumPy implementation in forge_accel/pixels.py is original.

Pillow, NumPy, pytest and setuptools are external dependencies, not included
source code in this archive. Their own licenses apply to their distributions.

The MIT license here covers this original package, not the user's separate
Pixel Forge project, external providers, researched repositories or art assets.
